      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "After complying with the provisions of Sec. 207 Cr. P.C., charge for offences u/s.\nState vs Sanjeev on 12 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/162982762/\n1 420/471/511 IPC were framed against the accused, to which he pleaded not guilty and claimed trial.",
