      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "3) In the present case, complainant Sh. Anil Bansal and witnesses Ms. Taripa D. and Savita Bahal were the only material witnesses for the prosecution out of which the complainant had expired and other two witnesses are not traceable.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2091,
      "end": 2325,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anil Bansal",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 2132,
          "end": 2143
        },
        {
          "text": "Taripa D.",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 2162,
          "end": 2171
        },
        {
          "text": "Savita Bahal",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 2176,
          "end": 2188
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "Other remaining witnesses were formal in nature and could not connect the guilt of the accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2326,
      "end": 2421,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Hence after hearing submissions of Ld. APP for state and counsel for accused, prosecution evidence was closed vide order dated 12.12.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2422,
      "end": 2560,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "12.12.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2549,
          "end": 2559
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "4) Since there is no incriminating evidence available on record against the accused, statement of accused u/s. 313 Cr. P.C is also dispensed with.",
